  "body": "Hi,\r\nI have been building an application that requires me to communicate with a micro controller. I initially send 2 bytes of data and the micro controller responds with 50 lines of data. Followed by me sending 2 bytes again and the cycle goes on for a few minutes. I observed that this is causing a high CPU usage on the client system. For very low end systems this has started to bottleneck my web application and my reads become delayed or very slowed after 30 seconds. On mid range to higher end systems, my reads get slow after 2 to 2.5 minutes. Any idea why this is happening or how to solve this?\r\n",
